    <tags>jorkonvo matrix chat discord voice video e2ee</tags>
    <summary>Discord-style chat client for the Matrix protocol</summary>
    <description>JorKonvo is a Discord-style client for the Matrix protocol: servers (spaces), roles, voice and video calls, end-to-end encryption. This is the desktop build (Tauri + WebView2).

Unsigned installer - Windows SmartScreen may warn on first run ("More info" -> "Run anyway"). A code-signing certificate is planned once the project has enough usage history for free OSS signing programs to accept it.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://git.szabotar.dev/thatumi/JorKonvo/releases/tag/windows-v0.1.5</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
